# Trivy ignore file — verified false positives only.
#
# CVE-2025-47273, CVE-2026-59890, GHSA-xmj3-9gf7-h52w (setuptools)
#   Trivy parses pip's VENDORED CycloneDX SBOM (pip/_vendor/bom.cdx.json,
#   shipped inside every pip>=26 wheel) and reads the setuptools 70.3.0 of
#   pip's own BUILD environment from it — hence the "Third-party SBOM may
#   lead to inaccurate vulnerability detection" warning next to these
#   findings. The setuptools actually installed in this image is 84.2.1
#   (>= the 78.1.1 / 83.0.0 / 84.1.0 fix versions of all three advisories),
#   verified independently by syft and grype in the sbom workflow and by
#   the pip install log ("Requirement already satisfied ... (84.2.1)").
#   Remove these entries when pip ships a wheel whose SBOM no longer
#   advertises the stale setuptools build-time version.
CVE-2025-47273
